<title>INDONESIA: Bank PDFCI 1996 net up to 31.84 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Bank PDFCI 1996 net up to 31.84 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(in billions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				31.84  vs   23.17</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	 340    vs   247</p>
<p>    Net interest income		   74.96  vs  55.79</p>
<p>    Other operating income		31.26  vs  15.84</p>
<p>    Other operating expenses	    61.06  vs  57.31</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  45.22  vs  27.65</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		     92.50  vs  70.97</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were audited. PT Bank Private Development Finance Company of Indonesia (PDFCI) is a medium-sized bank. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
